<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
<template id="report_transfer_letter">
     <t t-call="web.html_container">
            <t t-foreach="docs" t-as="o">
                <t t-call="web.external_layout">
                    <div class="page">
                        <div class="row mt32">
                            <div class="col-8">

                            </div>
                            <div class="col-4" style="float:left;">
                                 <strong>Date.:</strong>
                                <span t-esc="datetime.date.today()"/>
                                <br/>
                                  <strong>Ref.No:</strong>
									<span t-field="o.ref_num"/>
                                  <br />
								  <strong>ID.No.:</strong>
                                 <span t-field="o.employee_id"/>
                                <br />

                            </div>
                        </div>

                         <div class="row mt32">
                              <div class="col-12">
                                     
                                  <br/>
<!--                                <strong><span t-field="o.partner_name"/></strong>-->
                                <strong><span t-field="o.employee_name"/></strong>
                                  <br/>
                                <strong>Bunna Bank S.C</strong>
                                  <br/>
                                <strong>Addis Ababa</strong>
                                <br/>
                                <strong>Dear <span t-field="o.employee_name"/>,</strong>
<!--                                <strong>Dear <span t-field="o.partner_name"/>,</strong>-->
                            </div>
                             </div>
                        <h6 class="text-center"><strong><u>Subject: -Transfer</u></strong></h6>
                        <br/><br/><br/>
                        <p>It is to be recalled that you have been assigned as <strong><span t-field="o.job_position"/></strong>at <strong><span t-field="o.operating_unit"/></strong>  </p>

                        <br/>
                        <p>However, this is to inform you that you are transferred to<strong><span t-field="o.requested_operating_unit"/></strong> effective <strong><span t-field="o.releiving_date"/></strong> maintaining your current position of <strong><span t-field="o.job_position"/></strong>, Job grade of <strong><span t-field="o.job_grade"/> </strong>, monthly gross salary of <strong>Birr <span t-field="o.job_grade_id.base_salary"/></strong> and other benefits attached to the post.</p>
                        <br/>
                        <p>By copy of this letter, <strong><span t-field="o.operating_unit"/></strong> is advised to release <strong><span t-field="o.employee_name"/></strong>and <strong>Finance Directorate </strong>also forward payroll related information, Outstanding Loan Account details, Leave Status and any other necessary information to <strong><span t-field="o.requested_operating_unit"/> and Talent Management Directorate.</p><br/></strong> 
                        <br/>
                        <br/>
                    </div>
                <div>
                               <div class="row mt32">
                                   <br/>
                             <div class="col-6" >
                                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                                 <br/>
                                 <br/>


                                 <strong>CC:</strong>
                                 <t t-foreach="o.cc_workunits" t-as="related_record">
                                    <li><t t-esc="related_record.name"/></li>
                                    <!-- Add more fields as needed -->
                                </t>

<!--                                <span t-field="o.resignation_type" />-->
                                  <br />
                             </div>

                        </div>

                </div>

                </t>
            </t>
        </t>
</template>
</odoo>
